{"hw":"πᾶσις","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πᾶσις</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πᾶσις</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">εως</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">πάομαι</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">acquisition, possession</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span>; cj. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">B.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.42</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μοιριδία π</span>. prob. for <span class=\"gk\">πρᾶσις</span> in Philic. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Stud.Ital.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.44</span> </span>.</div></div>"}